   :status :pass :qemu-progress :pass
   :evidence ["receipt os/aiueos/qualification/receipts/vm-20261024/a1-qmp60/receipt.edn" "os/aiueos/qualification/receipts/vm-20261024/a1-qmp60/boot-times.log" "README.md capability table" "ADR-0220"]
   :note "Measured 2026-10-24: a production release image (no test-only input define) reaches the guest desktop; the QMP injector delivers a real virtio-keyboard event (AIUEOS_VIRTIO_INPUT_OK), the desktop markers appear and no evidence stage stops. The boot log records 62 s from QEMU start to the 60 s timeout with the desktop up. Caveat: the display is read back from the serial markers, not a screenshot; QEMU is stopped at 60 s while the desktop persists. A failed stage no longer ends the run."
